INSERT INTO skills_fts (id, name, owner, repo, category, search_text) VALUES ('nibzard/looper/release-runbook', 'release-runbook', 'nibzard', 'looper', 'community', 'release-runbook nibzard looper community The release-runbook skill automates the release workflow for developers, ensuring a clean and efficient process. It verifies repository state, runs tests, and publishes GitHub releases. Release Runbook是一种自动化GitHub发布工作流的工具，确保代码库的状态、运行测试、版本升级和发布 Release RunbookはGitHubリリースの自動化を実現するツールで、コードリポジトリの状態を確認し、テストを実行し、バージョンを昇格し、リリースを行う Release Runbook은 깃허브 자동 릴리즈 워크플ロー 툴로, 코드 저장소 상태 확인, 테스트 실행, 버전 업그레이드 및 릴리즈를 수행한다 Release Runbook es una herramienta que automatiza el flujo de trabajo de Git, verificando el estado del repositorio y publicando versiones. Release Runbook est un outil qui automatise le workflow Git, en vérifiant l''état du référentiel et en publiant des versions. Release Runbook ist ein Tool, das den Git-Workflow automatisiert, indem es den Repository-Zustand überprüft und Versionen veröffentlicht. O release-runbook é uma ferramenta que automatiza o fluxo de trabalho de lançamento, verificando o estado do repositório e publicando releases no GitHub. Release-runbook - это инструмент, автоматизирующий релизный workflow, проверяющий состояние репозитория и публикующий релизы на GitHub с помощью ИИ Агентов. release-runbook هو أداة تؤتمة تدفق العمل لإصدار البرامج، حيث يتحقق من حالة المستودع وينشر الإصدارات على GitHub how to use release-runbook release-runbook setup guide automated release workflow github release automation release-runbook vs manual deployment release-runbook install what is release-runbook release-runbook tutorial release-runbook best practices Release Runbook GitHub自动化 代码库状态检查 自动化测试 版本升级 GitHub Release AIエージェント 自动化发布工作流 Verifies repository state using `git status -s` and `git diff` Runs tests and bumps versions using language runtimes Publishes GitHub releases and updates downstream artifacts Checks remote repository using `git remote -v` Confirms GitHub authentication using `gh auth status` release-runbook is a skill that automates the release workflow, executing tasks such as verifying repository state, running tests, and publishing GitHub releases.');
