ues qui se concentre sur l''identification et la correction de la cause profonde d''un problème, plutôt que de ses seuls symptômes","de":"Fix-bug ist eine Fehlerbehebungstechnik, die sich auf die Identifizierung und Behebung der Ursache eines Problems konzentriert, anstatt nur seine Symptome","pt":"Fix-Bug é uma técnica de correção de bugs que se concentra na causa raiz do problema","ru":"Fix-Bug - это техника исправления ошибок, которая фокусируется на коренной причине неисправности ИИ Агентов","ar":"Fix-Bug هو تقنية ل修正 الأعطال تركز على السبب الجذري للعامل الذكي"},"features":{"en":["Identifies root causes of bugs, not just symptoms","Writes regression tests before fixing bugs","Ensures bugs never return by fixing the root cause","Follows a philosophy of fixing the root cause, not the symptom","Prevents symptom-chasing by focusing on root cause analysis","Supports deterministic bug fixing using regression tests"],"zh":["根本原因分析","回归测试","Null Pointer Exception处理","边界数据检查","代码修复和优化"],"ja":["根本原因解決","回帰テスト","Null Pointer Exception対策","境界データチェック","コード修正と最適化"],"ko":["근본원인 분석","회귀 테스트","Null Pointer Exception 처리","경계 데이터 체크","코드 수정과 최적화"],"es":["Identificación de la causa raíz de los errores","Corrección de errores enfocada en la causa raíz","Creación de pruebas de regresión para evitar la reaparición de errores","Análisis de síntomas para identificar patrones y causas","Implementación de soluciones efectivas para corregir errores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo para una corrección de errores más eficiente"],"fr":["Identification de la cause profonde des bogues","Correction de bogues ciblée sur la cause profonde","Création de tests de régression pour éviter la réapparition des bogues","Analyse des symptômes pour identifier des modèles et des causes","Mise en œuvre de solutions efficaces pour corriger les bogues","Intégration avec les outils de développement pour une correction de bogues plus efficace"],"de":["Identifizierung der Ursache von Fehlern","Fehlerbehebung, die sich auf die Ursache konzentriert","Erstellung von Regressions-tests, um die Wiederkehr von Fehlern zu vermeiden","Analyse von Symptomen, um Muster und Ursachen zu identifizieren","Implementierung effektiver Lösungen, um Fehler zu beheben","Integration mit Entwicklungstools für eine effizientere Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["Correção de causas raiz em vez de sintomas","Escrita de testes de regressão antes da correção","Prevenção de regressão de bugs","Identificação de dados inválidos","Uso de testes de unidade e integração"],"ru":["Устранение коренной причины неисправностей вместо симптомов ИИ Агентов","Написание тестов регрессии до исправления","Предотвращение регрессии ошибок","Определение недействительных данных","Использование модульных и интеграционных тестов"],"ar":["إصلاح الأسباب الجذرية بدلاً من الأعراض للعوامل الذكية","كتابة اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصلاح","منع رجوع الأعطال","التعرف على البيانات غير الصالحة","استخدام اختبارات الوحدة والتكامل"]},"keywords":{"en":["how to use fix-bug","what is fix-bug","fix-bug alternative","fix-bug vs debug-tool","fix-bug install","fix-bug setup guide","root cause bug fixing","regression testing best practices","symptom-chasing prevention"],"zh":["fix-bug","根本原因分析","回归测试","软件bug修复","AI工具","代码优化","边界数据检查","Null Pointer Exception"],"ja":["fix-bug","根本原因解決","回帰テスト","バグ修正","AIエージェント","コード最適化","境界データチェック","Null Pointer Exception"],"ko":["fix-bug","근본원인 분석","회귀 테스트","버그 수정","AI工具","코드 최적화","경계 데이터 체크","Null Pointer Exception"],"es":["fix-bug","corrección de errores","causa raíz","pruebas de regresión","análisis de síntomas","soluciones efectivas","herramientas de desarrollo","AI Agent","desarrollo de software","corrección de bogues"],"fr":["fix-bug","correction de bogues","cause profonde","tests de régression","analyse des symptômes","solutions efficaces","outils de développement","Outil IA","développement de logiciels","correction de bogues"],"de":["fix-bug","Fehlerbehebung","Ursache","Regressions-tests","Symptomanalyse","effektive Lösungen","Entwicklungstools","KI-Tool","Software-Entwicklung","Fehlerbehebung"],"pt":["correção de bugs","causa raiz","testes de regressão","prevenção de regressão","identificação de dados inválidos","desenvolvimento de software","engenharia de software","testes de unidade","testes de integração"],"ru":["исправление ошибок","коренная причина неисправностей","тесты регрессии","предотвращение регрессии","определение недействительных данных","разработка программного обеспечения","инженерия программного обеспечения","модульные тесты","интеграционные тесты","ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["إصلاح الأعطال","السبب الجذري","اختبارات الانحدار","منع رجوع الأعطال","التعرف على البيانات غير الصالحة","تطوير البرمجيات","هندسة البرمجيات","اختبارات الوحدة","اختبارات التكامل","العوامل الذكية"]}},"owner":"yon","repo":"agentic-dev-os","repoPath":"yon/agentic-dev-os","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-08T01:57:15.407Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"fix-bug","description":"Fix a bug with root cause analysis and regression testing. Trigger: fix bug, broken, regression, error, crash, not working, failing","bodyPreview":"# /fix-bug -- Root Cause Bug Fixing\n\n## Philosophy\n\nEvery bug has a root cause, and symptoms are not causes. A null pointer exception is a symptom -- the root cause is that invalid data wasn''t caught at the boundary. Fix the root cause, not the symptom. Always write a regression test BEFORE fixing -- this proves the bug exists and ensures it never returns. A bug fix without a regression test is an invitation for the bug to come back.\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Pattern: Symptom-Chasing\n\n```\nWRONG (symptom fix","body":"# /fix-bug -- Root Cause Bug Fixing\n\n## Philosophy\n\nEvery bug has a root cause, and symptoms are not causes. A null pointer exception is a symptom -- the root cause is that invalid data wasn''t caught at the boundary. Fix the root cause, not the symptom. Always write a regression test BEFORE fixing -- this proves the bug exists and ensures it never returns. A bug fix without a regression test is an invitation for the bug to come back.\n\n---\n\n## Anti-Pattern: Symptom-Chasing\n\n```\nWRONG (symptom fix):                   RIGHT (root cause fix):\n1. See NullPointerException            1. See NullPointerException\n2. Add null check where it crashes     2. Write regression test\n3. Ship it                             3. Trace: WHY is this null?\n4. Bug returns in different form       4. Find: validation missing at API boundary\n                                       5. Fix: add validation at boundary\n                                       6. Verify: regression test passes\n```\n\nSymptom-chasing treats every crash site as the problem. But a null that shouldn''t exist usually means it was allowed in somewhere upstream. Adding a null check at the crash site doesn''t stop the null from propagating through other code paths. Fixing at the boundary stops it everywhere.\n\n---\n\n## Workflow\n\n```\nStep 0: WORKTREE (mandatory)\n  |__ EnterWorktree(name=\"fix-[issue]\")\n\nStep 0.5: READ CONTEXT\n  |__ Read .context.md for the module where the bug manifests\n\nStep 1: GATHER INFORMATION\n  |__ Expected behavior?\n  |__ Actual behavior?\n  |__ Steps to reproduce?\n  |__ When did it start? (recent change? always broken?)\n  |__ Any error messages or logs?\n\nStep 2: REPRODUCE WITH TEST\n  |__ Write a test that demonstrates the failure\n  |__ Test MUST fail before the fix\n  |__ Name: test_[scenario]_should_[expected_behavior]\n  |__ Checklist:\n        [ ] Test fails\n        [ ] Test fails for the RIGHT reason\n        [ ] Test describes correct behavior (not buggy behavior)\n\nStep 3: ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS\n  |__ Read relevant code\n  |__ Trace execution path from input to failure\n  |__ Identify WHERE behavior diverges from expectation\n  |__ Ask: \"Why does this happen?\" then ask \"Why?\" again\n  |     (Keep asking until you reach the actual cause)\n  |__ Document the root cause (not the symptom)\n  |__ Checklist:\n        [ ] Root cause identified (not symptom)\n        [ ] Can explain WHY the bug occurs\n        [ ] Can explain why the fix prevents recurrence\n\nStep 4: PLAN & FIX\n  |__ For non-trivial bugs: save plan to working/plans/\n  |__ Implement minimal fix at the root cause\n  |__ Don''t refactor unrelated code\n  |__ Checklist:\n        [ ] Fix addresses root cause\n        [ ] Fix is minimal (no scope creep)\n        [ ] No unrelated changes mixed in\n\nStep 5: VERIFY\n  |__ Regression test now PASSES\n  |__ make check -- all green, no regressions\n  |__ Checklist:\n        [ ] Regression test passes\n        [ ] Full suite passes\n        [ ] No new warnings introduced\n\nStep 6: UPDATE CONTEXT\n  |__ Update .context.md with bug root cause and fix description\n\nStep 7: REVIEW\n  |__ Spawn review subagents:\n        - code-reviewer (fix quality)\n        - test-reviewer (regression test quality)\n\nStep 8: DELIVER\n  |__ Present summary:\n  |     - Root cause explanation\n  |     - What was changed (minimal diff)\n  |     - Regression test added\n  |     - Full suite results\n  |__ Commit message format:\n        fix(scope): short description\n\n        Root cause: [explanation]\n        Regression test: [test name]\n\n        Closes #[issue]\n```\n\n---\n\n## Rules\n\n- **ALWAYS write regression test BEFORE fixing** -- the test proves the bug exists\n- **Test must FAIL before fix and PASS after** -- this is non-negotiable\n- **Fix the root cause, not the symptom** -- ask \"why?\" until you find the real cause\n- **Minimal change** -- fix the bug, don''t refactor surrounding code\n- **Commit test WITH fix** -- they travel together, always\n\n---\n\n## Options\n\n- `/fix-bug [issue number or description]` -- start with context\n- `/fix-bug` -- interactive, asks for bug description\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-08T02:06:57.027Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Code Review Agents needing root cause analysis and regression testing capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要根因分析和回归测试能力的代码审查代理。","ja":"コードレビューエージェントがルート原因分析と回帰テストの機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"루트 원인 분석 및 회귀 테스트 기능이 필요한 코드 리뷰 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Revisión de Código que necesitan análisis de causa raíz y capacidades de prueba de regresión.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Révision de Code nécessitant une analyse de cause racine et des capacités de test de régression.","de":"Perfekt für Code-Review-Agents, die eine Ursachenanalyse und Regressionstestfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Revisão de Código que necessitam de análise de causa raiz e capacidades de teste de regressão.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Кодового Обзора, которым необходимы возможности анализа коренной причины и регрессионного тестирования.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات مراجعة الكود التي تحتاج إلى تحليل السبب الجذري وقدرات اختبار الانحدار."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to identify and fix root causes of bugs, not just symptoms, by writing regression tests before fixing, ensuring bugs never return and improving code quality through rigorous testing protocols.","zh":"使代理能够通过编写修复前的回归测试来识别和修复错误的根因，而不仅仅是症状，确保错误永远不会再次出现，并通过严格的测试协议来提高代码质量。","ja":"エージェントが修正前の回帰テストを書いてバグの根本原因を特定し、修正してバグが再発しないようにし、厳格なテストプロトコルでコード品質を向上させることができる。","ko":"에이전트가 버그를 수정하기 전에 회귀 테스트를 작성하여 버그의 근본 원인을 식별하고 수정하여 버그가 다시 발생하지 않도록 하며 엄격한 테스트 프로토콜을 통해 코드 품질을 향상시킬 수 있습니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a identificar y solucionar las causas raíz de los errores, no solo los síntomas, escribiendo pruebas de regresión antes de solucionar, asegurando que los errores nunca regresen y mejorando la calidad del código a través de protocolos de prueba rigurosos.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''identifier et de corriger les causes profondes des bogues, et non seulement les symptômes, en écrivant des tests de régression avant de corriger, garantissant que les bogues ne reviennent jamais et améliorant la qualité du code grâce à des protocoles de test rigoureux.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, die Ursachen von Fehlern zu identifizieren und zu beheben, und nicht nur die Symptome, indem sie Regressionstests schreiben, bevor sie die Fehler beheben, und so sicherstellen, dass die Fehler nie wieder auftreten und die Codequalität durch strenge Testprotokolle verbessern.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a identificar e corrigir as causas raiz dos bugs, e não apenas os sintomas, escrevendo testes de regressão antes de corrigir, garantindo que os bugs nunca retornem e melhorando a qualidade do código por meio de protocolos de teste rigorosos.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью выявлять и исправлять коренные причины ошибок, а не только симптомы, путем написания регрессионных тестов до исправления, обеспечивая, чтобы ошибки никогда не возвращались и улучшая качество кода посредством строгих протоколов тестирования.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من تحديد وتصحيح الأسباب الجذريّة للأخطاء، وليس مجرد الأعراض، من خلال كتابة اختبارات الانحدار قبل الإصلاح، مما يضمن ألا تعود الأخطاء مرة أخرى وتحسين جودة الكود من خلال بروتوكولات الاختبار القاسية."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex issues with regression testing","Writing unit tests to prevent bug recurrence","Analyzing stack traces to identify root causes"],"zh":["使用回归测试调试复杂问题","编写单元测试以防止错误再现","分析堆栈跟踪以确定根因"],"ja":["回帰テストを使用して複雑な問題をデバッグする","バグの再発を防ぐためにユニットテストを書く","スタックトレースを分析して根本原因を特定する"],"ko":["회귀 테스트를 사용하여 복잡한 문제를 디버깅하는 것","오류가 다시 발생하지 않도록 단위 테스트를 작성하는 것","스택 트레이스를 분석하여 근본 원인을 식별하는 것"],"es":["Depuración de problemas complejos con pruebas de regresión","Escritura de pruebas unitarias para prevenir la recurrencia de errores","Análisis de trazas de pila para identificar causas raíz"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes complexes avec des tests de régression","Écriture de tests unitaires pour prévenir la récurrence des bogues","Analyse des traces de pile pour identifier les causes profondes"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung komplexer Probleme mit Regressionstests","Schreiben von Einheitstests, um das Wiederauftreten von Fehlern zu verhindern","Analyse von Stacktraces, um Ursachen zu identifizieren"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas complexos com teste de regressão","Escrita de testes unitários para prevenir a recorrência de bugs","Análise de rastros de pilha para identificar causas raiz"],"ru":["Отладка сложных проблем с помощью регрессионного тестирования","Написание юнит-тестов для предотвращения повторения ошибок","Анализ стек-трейсов для выявления коренных причин"],"ar":["تصحيح الأخطاء المعقدة باستخدام اختبار الانحدار","كتابة اختبارات الوحدة لمنع تكرار الأخطاء","تحليل مسارات المكدس لتحديد الأسباب الجذريّة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires programming language support for regression testing","Needs access to codebase for analysis and modification"],"zh":["需要编程语言支持回归测试","需要访问代码库以进行分析和修改"],"ja":["回帰テストをサポートするプログラミング言語が必要","分析および変更のためにコードベースへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["회귀 테스트를 지원하는 프로그래밍 언어가 필요합니다","분석 및 수정을 위해 코드베이스에 액세스해야 합니다"],"es":["Requiere soporte de lenguaje de programación para pruebas de regresión","Necesita acceso a la base de código para análisis y modificación"],"fr":["Nécessite un support de langage de programmation pour les tests de régression","A besoin d''un accès à la base de code pour l''analyse et la modification"],"de":["Benötigt Sprachunterstützung für Regressionstests","Benötigt Zugriff auf den Codebestand für Analyse und Modifikation"],"pt":["Exige suporte de linguagem de programação para teste de regressão","Necessita acesso ao código-fonte para análise e modificação"],"ru":["Требует поддержки языка программирования для регрессионного тестирования","Требует доступа к кодовой базе для анализа и модификации"],"ar":["يتطلب دعم لغة البرمجة لاختبار الانحدار","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى قاعدة الشفرة للتحليل والتعديل"]},"version":4},"contentHash":"10eacbee6ffec1f3e8e2fa52d879ce1e368aa3113a5a9d785acb9e77e56e2abe","qualityScore":36}');
